"The `//` and `#` glyphs are proposals from David Faulks (Unicode "
"L2/16-174, 2016) — not yet in the Unicode standard. Text abbreviations "
"`P` / `CP` match Solar Fire and Astrodienst conventions and are used as "
"the `kind` field values in `DECLA_ASPECT_DTYPE`."
